msgid "description_hazard_categories_maintenance"
msgstr "Maintain the list of Hazard categories selectable in Reference Definition / Reference Sample. Click <strong>[+ Add new row]</strong> to add a record and edit fields directly in the table. After changes, click <strong>[Save]</strong> per row or <strong>[Save all changes]</strong> above. Fields per row: <code>CODE</code> unique code, <code>Name</code> English name, <code>Common</code> common name, <code>Pictogram</code> pictogram path."

msgid "Hazard categories"
msgstr "Hazard categories"

msgid "每行一条，格式为：CODE|Name|Common|pictogram-path 。修改后立即生效，Reference Definition / Reference Sample 里的 Hazard categories 候选项会直接从这份配置读取。"
msgstr "One per line in format CODE|Name|Common|pictogram-path. Changes take effect immediately. Candidates for Reference Definition / Reference Sample Hazard categories are read directly from this configuration."

msgid "Hazard categories (JSON)"
msgstr "Hazard categories (JSON)"

msgid "按行存储的结构化 Hazard categories JSON 列表。每行包含 uid/code/name/common/pictogram 字段。由数据表维护界面自动生成，与 categories 文本字段双向同步。不要手动修改此字段。"
msgstr "Line-stored structured Hazard categories JSON list. Each line contains uid/code/name/common/pictogram fields. Auto-generated by the data-table maintenance UI, bidirectionally synchronised with the categories text field. Do not edit this field manually."

